        </property>
        <property name="text">
         <string>Free codecs included: AV1, VP8, VP9, DNxHD, Vorbis, Opus, FLAC, PCM.
H.264/H.265 decoding included for playback support.
Hardware-accelerated H.264/H.265 encoders (requires an NVIDIA GPU).
Does NOT include software H.264/H.265, AAC, or MP3 encoders.
Safe for personal or commercial use without additional licenses.</string>
        </property>
       </widget>
      </item>
      <item>
       <widget class="QRadioButton" name="systemRb">
        <property name="text">
         <string>Use an existing FFmpeg on your system</string>
